			"notes": "## Cobblemon Pasture Loot 2.0.0\n\nNew major version for **Cobblemon 1.8** on Minecraft 1.21.1, now on **Fabric and NeoForge**. For Cobblemon 1.7, keep using 1.0.x.\n\n### New\n\n- Added **NeoForge support**\n- New config file `config/pastureloot.toml`. Your old `PastureLoot.json` is converted on the first start\n- Drop rate now in drops per hour\n- Item tags in the filter\n- Friendship bonus\n- Item limit (anti-lag)\n- Loot table overrides\n- Dimension taken into account\n\n### Changed\n\n- A drop now gives every item rolled from the drop table of the pokémon, where 1.0.x picked only one of them.\n- Forms that need several aspects (Galarian Darmanitan) now drop from their own table.\n- The default filter uses item tags for meat and fish, so it also covers tropical fish and the meat of other mods that use these tags.\n- The `legacy_flatten_item_quantity` setting is removed, quantities always follow Cobblemon."
		},
